        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "page_footnote",
        "text": "d〔巾〕这封信写在一条白布方巾上，故云。",
        "bbox": [
            105,
            868,
            413,
            885
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "page_footnote",
        "text": "e〔模拟〕想象，揣摩。",
        "bbox": [
            105,
            884,
            277,
            902
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "page_footnote",
        "text": "i〔四鼓〕四更天。",
        "bbox": [
            531,
            868,
            673,
            884
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "page_footnote",
        "text": "j〔诸母〕各位伯母、叔母。",
        "bbox": [
